name biblatex-license
category Package
revision 58437
shortdesc Add license data to the bibliography
longdesc This package is for adding license data to bibliography entries
longdesc via BibLaTeX's built-in related mechanism. It provides a new
longdesc relatedtype license and some bibmacros for typesetting these
longdesc related entries.
